abstract: >-
  Executable supplement to "A Calculus of Execution for Systems of Interacting Binary Relations":
  a minimal zero-tier execution substrate Z0 that applies Axiom 0 to systems of abstractions given
  as JSON specifications, with nine worked examples, eight defective mechanisms for the essential
  conditions of S1, and replay under R2.
keywords: [execution calculus, binary relations, append-only record, replay, admission]
